{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef73f9cb-a804-8879-a85d-5a70bfa74089",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T09:38:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'm calling about a pothole on my street. It's gotten bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. What street is it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Broadway, in the North End. The pothole is in front of 239 Broadway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "239 Broadway, got it. And can you tell me about the size of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's deep. It would swallow a tire. I'm not exaggerating. A car goes in there and you feel it in the whole frame."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. So deep enough to swallow a tire. Is it in the travel lane or off to the side by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the travel lane, right where the cars come down the hill toward the corner. People swerve around it into the other lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good to know, because the swerving is part of the concern. Has anyone damaged a vehicle that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't heard of any damage. I've seen a few cars bottom out. I have photos, if you want them. I took four of them yesterday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, photos would help. I can give you an email for the department to send those to, or you can bring them in. Would either of those work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send them. Go ahead with the email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Actually, let me make sure I give you the right one. Hold on one moment while I pull it up. [pause] Sorry about that. I'm going to have the crew supervisor's office reach out to you instead, and you can reply to their message with the pictures. Is this the best number for you, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0163. Under the name Manuel Costa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Costa, C-O-S-T-A. Manuel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Costa. Now, what would you like us to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like Broadway added to the repair list. This stretch by 239. I know there's a list. I want it on there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put it in as a request for the pothole crew. So that's the travel lane on Broadway, at 239, about a tire deep, with photos coming. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And is there a time of day when it's worse? Heavier traffic, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings. The school day starts at eight, so everybody is racing the clock. Parents dropping off, buses, people trying to get to work. Nobody slows down for it until they're in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, a busy morning stretch. I'll note the school traffic in the request, because that can move it up a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you know when somebody will come out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The crews are working through a backlog from the winter, so it could be a week or two, depending on the weather. If it's dry and above freezing, they tend to get a lot done in a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. All right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets worse before then, or someone does hit it, call back and tell us, and we'll add that to the request. Is there anything else on Broadway you wanted to mention?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's the one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I have Manuel Costa, 239 Broadway, deep pothole in the travel lane, photos to follow, number 401-555-0163. Someone will be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Costa. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T09:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
